'''Nekondo''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] who was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and has a 30% chance to be obtained when clearing [[Punchy Prizefighter]]. He later received a [[True Form]] in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] in which he gained a 20% chance to produce a level 2 [[Wave Attack]]. Later on, he reappears in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.5]] but is only exclusive to the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version via Package Version Bonus.

