==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nekondo HG''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Nekondo SP''' when obtained from [[Nekondo Awakens!]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has low overall stats, which heavily limits its usage. In early game, it can be used as RNG-reliant [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], but once the latter has been acquired, this unit serves almost no use.

